<title>USA: Horizon Group Q4 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Horizon Group Q4 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>NORTON SHORES, Mich. 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $2.27   profit	 $0.39</p>
<p> Net loss		  62,055   profit	 9,962</p>
<p> Revs			41,629		   36,219</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  22,141		   18,454</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.34   profit	 $1.52</p>
<p> Net loss		  34,989   profit	28,147</p>
<p> Revs		     154,499		   93,929</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  20,395		   14,016</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 1996 includes write-downs of $61.7 million related to cost overruns and limited success in leasing its Dole Cannery project in Honolulu, Hawaii, which required a write down of its investment in that project and a reserve against a related receivable.</p>
<p>Q4 and year end 1996 results also include one-time charges of $2.2 million related to development projects which will not be pursued and a $1.5 million provision for severance costs.</p>
<p>Full company name is Horizon Group Inc</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
